    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB0LC_1LC0RD_1LA0RB_0RB1LC p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB0LC_1LC0RD_1LA0RB_0RB1LC p j' E).
